          ],
          "retained": [
            "Partition generation into contiguous blocks using the actual OpenMP team size, with exact 64-bit modular jump-ahead for both MWC states.",
            "Preserve unsigned recurrence arithmetic, signed abs conversion and floating-point scaling order; restore the global RNG state after exactly N updates.",
