        "hypothesis_as_declared_by_model": "An 8-bit MSB distribution followed by three bucket-local LSD passes should improve cache and TLB locality over the measured flat four-pass radix variant, while retaining four scatter passes and avoiding final copy-back.",
        "transformations_as_declared_by_model": {
